{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>HOY處境劇《你的保安李寶安》第6集，保安室面臨紀律大危機之際卻遇上神智不清孫婆婆大鬧尋找「乖孫」。保安團隊為維護住客利益展開全城尋孫大行動，沒想到這位神祕「乖孫」真實身分竟然與屯門兆康苑拯救事件息息相關！</p>\n<h2>李寶安整頓軍紀遇孫婆婆</h2>\n<p>劇情講述保安室紀律每況愈下，各人以輸馬、煲碟及生飛滋等理由遲到，主角李寶安決心重整軍紀。就在此時，鬼馬又時而糊塗孫婆婆突然大鬧保安室，並當場錯認麥峰為親生兒子，強烈要求對方協助尋找失散「孫仔」。為了維護住客利益及平息風波，一眾保安員唯有各顯神通，硬著頭皮展開尋找乖孫大行動，從而在尋找過程中揭開一段真實動物棄養悲歌。</p>\n<h2>導演何爵天邀救援機構「龜途」合作</h2>\n<p>面對這次破格劇本設定，導演何爵天特別邀請動物救援機構「龜途」合作參與拍攝。機構其後在社交平台發文致謝，透露這次出鏡小小演員其實是一隻曾在屯門兆康苑獲救反甲巴西龜。機構在聲明中表示：「好感謝何爵天導演的邀請，參與《你的保安李寶安》第6集拍攝！」他們提到以往常見處境劇植入式廣告，這次卻成功在劇中植入愛護動物訊息。</p>\n<h2>顧問邦Sir即場示範正確抱龜姿勢</h2>\n<p>這次跨界合作並非單純借用動物作為拍攝道具，動物救援機構顧問邦Sir親自帶領反甲龜到場，並以顧問身份在現場分享這隻巴西龜背後驚險拯救故事。為了配合劇情需要，邦Sir親自向演員示範如何正確拿起龜隻，全程將動物健康放在首位。機構特別感謝劇組植入「愛護動物、尊重生命、無分種類」這項重要訊息。</p>\n<h2>網民讚棄養劇情具意義 大讚龜龜演技</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，大批觀眾紛紛留言發表觀後感。有網民笑言「話時話啲龜都好識做戲」。同時也有不少人被劇情觸動，留言表示「第6集嘅劇情溫馨又感動，提出棄養動物」、「今集好有情同教育意義，讚」、「幾好睇，算有貼地嘅」。網上討論區充斥關於棄養動物議題各項討論。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371475674758725_17556615716ae9ea452a3e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-861EP6XWalletHOY-YouTube-19’03”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371475674758725_17556615716ae9ea452a3e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>HOY處境劇《你的保安李寶安》第6集，保安室面臨紀律大危機之際卻遇上神智不清孫婆婆大鬧尋找「乖孫」。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371534880817194_12358465136ae9ec951930f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371534880817194_12358465136ae9ec951930f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>為了維護住客利益及平息風波，一眾保安員唯有各顯神通，硬著頭皮展開尋找乖孫大行動。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535255496328_3762855906ae9ec98d1a39.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535255496328_3762855906ae9ec98d1a39.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網民笑言「話時話啲龜都好識做戲」。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535709155916_8507581766ae9ec9d75e2e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371535709155916_8507581766ae9ec9d75e2e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>動物救援機構顧問邦Sir親自帶領反甲龜到場，並以顧問身份在現場分享這隻巴西龜背後驚險拯救故事。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536112416190_12968692356ae9eca16a299.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536112416190_12968692356ae9eca16a299.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536490136260_17833005226ae9eca527326.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536490136260_17833005226ae9eca527326.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536903681426_4019371536ae9eca9609a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371536903681426_4019371536ae9eca9609a2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:13.028762+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1192,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:16:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:58:44.338464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:43.657215+00:00","content_hash":"7d9e885ed354fd45f188d42000e0a880ea429b11c769461210d75c5c45ea5464","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}